 r←cloneList arg;n;ix;pfx
⍝ Space-separated names of the live per-session clones, sorted by their
⍝ numeric suffix. EWC names each clone after this namespace, so the prefix
⍝ tracks the directory this app is linked from.

 pfx←'multitest_'
 n←{⍵~' '}¨↓#.⎕NL 9
 n←n/⍨{pfx≡(≢pfx)↑⍵}¨n

 :If 0=≢n
     r←'(none)'
 :Else
     ix←{⊃2⊃⎕VFI(≢pfx)↓⍵}¨n
     n←n[⍋ix]
     r←1↓∊' ',¨n
 :EndIf
